<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Prompts for the Overall Pipeline</h2>

<figure id="A3.F4" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt1.svg" id="A3.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/393;" width="548" height="393"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Prompt for instructing MLLMs to identify main active entities in the video.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F5" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt2.svg" id="A3.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/179;" width="548" height="179"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Prompt for instructing MLLMs to generate a video summary.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F6" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt3.svg" id="A3.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/410;" width="548" height="410"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Prompt for instructing MLLMs to generate transcriptions for speech.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F7" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt4.svg" id="A3.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:548/477;" width="548" height="477"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Prompt for instructing MLLMs to identify non-speech sounds.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F8" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt5.svg" id="A3.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:548/691;" width="548" height="691"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Prompt for instructing MLLMs to identify speakers based on audio-visual cues.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F9" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt6.svg" id="A3.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:548/444;" width="548" height="444"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Prompt for instructing MLLMs to generate visual descriptions.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F10" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt7.svg" id="A3.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:548/768;" width="548" height="768"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Prompt for Global Clue Mining of Clue-Guided Generation (Causal Reasoning).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F11" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt8.svg" id="A3.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:548/688;" width="548" height="688"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Prompt for Locally Focused Generation of Clue-Guided Generation: generating open-ended QA pairs (Causal Reasoning).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F12" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt9-1.svg" id="A3.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:548/643;" width="548" height="643"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span>Prompt for Locally Focused Generation of Clue-Guided Generation: generating multiple-choice questions.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F13" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14702v1/prompt9-2.svg" id="A3.F13.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:548/538;" width="548" height="538"></object>
